1601277661846_5428982906936699612_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_mF0SRSfVqgQ7kNvwE1leT2&_nc_oc=AdrxiE5fMkb82qF3hPceig0YQlL2Rhc6NoK8laH2BzH-Lm-6204I2wYUocmpDfgam8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW57zwebuYGRhisLtSQ4p2A3vwWO76_8ZxIu-9jiecRLw&oe=6B0F09AF"}, {"file_name": "Screengrabs_4.png", "id": "507102677251409", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75395590_507102680584742_7420227356861752672_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1-jmt0gzKTMQ7kNvwHwcUPO&_nc_oc=AdrkLdh_Tq9X1w4HQlPJdZqUKVfqBdcW0o9esdZac2jwBYSuMmYCad0Lei2GG4uuT20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXxzJLc-7WIUaAemKKn0tSnaxqrJv6qEzCEb9S3pkdibw&oe=6B0F08A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Curatours", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Visitors can access tours of museums around the world from their desktops, phones or VR headsets. In VR it's an incredibly immersive experience and on other devices it's a bit like a cross between a Zoom Call and playing a game. \n\nYou can choose from three types of tour:\n \nSelf-guided tours can happen at anytime, just login and go exploring!\n \nPre-recorded tours are similar to a self-guided tour only at points a guide will appear to tell you something about that place or the artefact you\u2019re near. It\u2019s a bit like a 3D audio guide.\n \nLive-guided tours put you in a museum or gallery with an expert so you can talk to them and ask questions. To get a live-guided tour you will need to book on to one of the timeslots available. ", "short_description": "Visit art exhibitions and museums with friends and family. Everyone can explore and experience the tours using a either a PC, tablet, smartphone or virtual reality headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.coopinnovations.co.uk/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_se